  "regenerate": "scratchpad/build_oracle.py; the parser is described in tests/test_powershell_4104.py",
  "repo": "https://github.com/splunk/security_content",
  "what": "Each detection's leading filter, parsed into a boolean AST over ScriptBlockText. Nodes: [\"and\",[..]] [\"or\",[..]] [\"not\",n] [\"match\",glob] [\"true\"]. Anything not about ScriptBlockText \u2014 the powershell macro, EventCode, a Path clause \u2014 is [\"true\"], which keeps the oracle conservative: it can say a detection fires when the full search would not, never the reverse."
